# No file in this repository is tracked in LFS any more. unified_courses.json,
# the only one that ever was, was removed on 2026-09-04: a committed copy of the
# dataset is a public URL that bypasses the human-verification gate.
#
# The warning outlives the rule it was written for. Never glob a structured-text
# extension: an unqualified *.json LFS rule previously swallowed package.json and
# package-lock.json, so a clone without `git lfs pull` got 130-byte pointers.
*.json text eol=lf
